  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposal fails to demonstrate that the proposed development would not increase flood risk or prejudice the structural integrity, maintenance, access to, or future de-culverting of the culverted main river watercourse adjoining the site. Insufficient information has been submitted to identify the exact location, depth and condition of the culvert, the relationship of the proposed development and its foundations to the culvert, or whether an appropriate 8 metre buffer would be maintained. The proposal is therefore contrary to Core Policy 28 of the Enfield Core Strategy, DMD Policies 59, 60, 61, 62 and 63 Policies SI 12 and SI 13 of the London Plan, and the National Planning Policy Framework."
